 infrastructure on AWS, using Amazon API Gateway to open its doors, easily integrating and communicating with a wide number of partners. Tradeling now has 200,000 registered business customers, with a growing product range and partner list.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tradeling-logo%401x.7b4d508ee8494469c2025a8dde65626451d1062c.png","displayLocation":"United Arab Emirates","customerNameLower":"tradeling","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Retail","sortDate":"2023-08-21","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/tradeling-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Tradeling","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Tradeling Builds Scalable, Secure B2B Marketplace Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Identity and Access Management","description":"AWS Identity and Access Management","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uae","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Arab Emirates","description":"United Arab Emirates","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","des