dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eventbridge","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EventBridge","description":"Amazon EventBridge","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#snowmobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Snowmobile","description":"AWS Snowmobile","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:01+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#directconnect","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Direct Connect","description":"AWS Direct Connect","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#translate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Translate","description":"Amazon Translate","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#private-5g","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Private 5G","description":"AWS Private 5G","dateCreated":"2021-12-16T04:57:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:55+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lifen","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lifen","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:59:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-09-07T23:50:14+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eLes services manag\u0026eacute;s, la certification HDS (H\u0026eacute;bergeur de donn\u0026eacute;es de sant\u0026eacute;) ainsi que l\u0026rsquo;adaptabilit\u0026eacute; des services d\u0026rsquo;AWS ont permis \u0026agrave; Lifen de mettre \u0026agrave; l\u0026#39;\u0026eacute;chelle (scaler) ses solutions tout en maintenant ses SLAs sans impacter la fiabilit\u0026eacute; de ses services ou sa capacit\u0026eacute; d\u0026#39;innovation, sur un march\u0026eacute; en plein essor. Fond\u0026eacute;e en 2015, Lifen facilite le d\u0026eacute;ploiement de solutions num\u0026eacute;riques aupr\u0026egrave;s des h\u0026ocirc;pitaux, m\u0026eacute;decins et patients en simplifiant le partage de la donn\u0026eacute;e m\u0026eacute;dicale. Forte d\u0026rsquo;une expertise leader en interop\u0026eacute;rabilit\u0026eacute; et en Intelligence Artificielle, Lifen a cr\u0026eacute;\u0026eacute; une plateforme qui structure la donn\u0026eacute;e, permet l\u0026rsquo;alimentation rapide et efficace des dossiers patient informatis\u0026eacute;s, et simplifie radicalement l\u0026rsquo;int\u0026eacute;gration technique et le d\u0026eacute;ploiement op\u0026eacute;rationnel de solutions de e-sant\u0026eacute; dans les syst\u0026egrave;mes informatiques hospitaliers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/lifen_image.9f6993bd6d6a22cccd56cc38f76fbcbb28668ee2.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/lifen_logo.e944775d9edf0dc18fcb6a5cc089a4ef4525b712.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"lifen","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/lifen/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Lifen","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"AWS accompagne les solutions d\u0027échanges de données médicales proposées par Lifen"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#prof-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Professional Services","description":"Professional Services","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:07:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudhsm","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudHSM","description":"AWS CloudHSM","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:48+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#emr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EMR","description":"Amazon EMR","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#french","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"French","description":"French","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#key-mgmt-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Key Management Service (KMS)","description":"AWS Key Management Service (KMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jump","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jump","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:44:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d6Uq9Qvtzitw","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eJump facilite le quotidien des personnes souhaitant devenir freelances en leur proposant de les embaucher en CDI - tout en restant leur propre patron sans avoir \u0026agrave; g\u0026eacute;rer le volet administratif. Sebastian CACERES, CTO chez Jump, partage l\u0026rsquo;ambition de multiplier par 5 le nombre de salari\u0026eacute;s freelances d\u0026rsquo;ici fin 2022. Sa probl\u0026eacute;matique principale : rester proche des clients en proposant une disponibilit\u0026eacute; en continue et une structure pour ses utilisateurs. Le Cloud AWS a su fournir les fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s permettant \u0026agrave; Jump de r\u0026eacute;pondre \u0026agrave; ses besoins de haute disponibilit\u0026eacute;, flexibilit\u0026eacute;, scalabilit\u0026eacute; et de s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; pour un investissement moindre en amont. Le passage au cloud a eu pour effet d\u0026rsquo;offrir plus d\u0026rsquo;agilit\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; Jump en leur permettant de faire du test and learn gr\u0026acirc;ce aux diff\u0026eacute;rentes fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s et services propos\u0026eacute;s. Jump souhaite aller plus loin et s\u0026rsquo;int\u0026eacute;resse aujourd\u0026rsquo;hui \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;architecture bas\u0026eacute;e sur des \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nements, la scalabilit\u0026eacute; et les services \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;chelle mondiale.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Uq9Qvtzitw/maxresdefault.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/%c3%89tude%20de%20cas%20AWS%20%20Jump.ba964f2b5a82506027f093a6dd39620de314eb70.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"jump","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/jump/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jump","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headl