rds componenet on aws.amazon.com/power-and-utilities/case-studies/ and/or aws.amazon.com/energy/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from multiple tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:35:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:35:16+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#tnex-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"tnex-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-09-11T00:49:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T23:23:33+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"TNEX was able to launch its digital-native mobile bank on AWS in just nine months with the help of TechX, an AWS Partner. TNEX is Vietnam’s first fully digital bank, offering a retail app for consumers and a separate app for small to medium businesses. The company uses Amazon ECS to run containers in a microservices framework, Amazon GuardDuty for intelligent threat protection, and AWS WAF to help secure its application layers.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/TNEX_logo%401x.4e942ad2223badbcb0fc33c6d352d0e31c80be9c.png","displayLocation":"Vietnam","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2021-09-10","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/tnex-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"TNEX Launches Vietnam’s First Digital Bank in Nine Months on AWS","customer-name":"TNEX"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#key-mgmt-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Key Management Service (KMS)","description":"AWS Key Management Ser